From 865d13bf98a265b89325570ca0990b312179b039 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:21:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Box: review fixes from 2 November

Shader previews keep the source bound when a look-up texture reloads;
bezels only scan 32-bit artwork and the bezel shortcut needs a game;
the slideshow only stops its own moving-photo clip, and XMP container
items are read in element form too.
